 "description": "List a company's transaction categorization rules in the order they are evaluated (lowest priority number first; the first match wins). Each rule states which merchants, amounts or directions it matches, which chart-of-accounts account matching transactions are booked to, its status (DRAFT books nothing until a person approves it; ACTIVE; PAUSED) and posting (REVIEW queues bookings for a person; AUTO_POST posts them), and its health: applied_count, last_applied_at, correction_count (bookings a person later moved to another account), dead (in force 90 days and never won), and clean_bookings_in_window of track_record_window. Pass include_inactive to see drafts and paused rules. Read-only.",
 "inputSchema": {
